version: 1.0.0
abstract: >-
  Automated estimation of the solid wood content of roundwood
  truckloads from photogrammetric point clouds: bay
  individualisation, base-plane alignment, Poisson surface
  reconstruction, gross volume integration and regression to
  solid volume.
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: >-
    Deep learning and photogrammetry for automated solid wood
    content estimation in roundwood truckloads
